{"unit_id":"Hyna-hla__dsh-snapshot#card-zh","repo":"Hyna-hla/dsh-snapshot","commit":"ccbe77e5e42416db3e9f36b61ff98d3df3ac2a9b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapshot 是 DSH 文件快照与会话导出插件，通过工具钩子在 write/edit 执行前备份文件。它把版本存入工作区，可列出历史、恢复指定版本并在恢复前备份现状，也能清空快照。另提供会话导出工具，可写出 Markdown 或 JSON。适合需要撤销文件改动或保存会话记录的 DSH 用户。它使用 DSH 的 fs、agents、sessionQuery 和 sandboxPolicy 服务，不需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:105-119","lib/index.js:273-415"]}
{"unit_id":"Hyna-hla__dsh-snapshot#card-en","repo":"Hyna-hla/dsh-snapshot","commit":"ccbe77e5e42416db3e9f36b61ff98d3df3ac2a9b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-snapshot adds file snapshots and session export to DSH. A hook backs up files before write/edit operations. Users can list and restore versions, clear history, and export the current session as Markdown or JSON. It uses DSH services and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:105-119","lib/index.js:273-415"]}
